

# 1) Maven / Java generated outputs
**/target/
**/out/
*.class

# 2) IDE and editor metadata
.idea/
*.iml
.classpath
.project
.settings/
.vscode/

# 3) Runtime logs, process state and crash dumps
*.log
!artifacts/**/*.log
logs/
*.pid
*.pid.lock
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# 4) Machine-specific configuration and secrets
.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*-local.properties
**/secrets.properties
**/secrets/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks

# 5) Local PostgreSQL storage and database backups
**/pgdata/
**/postgres-data/
docker/volumes/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.dump
*.backup

# 6) Operating-system and editor temporary files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*~
*.swp
*.swo

# 7) Formal acceptance evidence - 30-day plan (D01-D30)
# The MASTER sheet explicitly requires artifacts/evidence/Dxx/*.
# Keep runtime logs ignored elsewhere, but allow reviewed test logs here.
!artifacts/evidence/
!artifacts/evidence/**/
!artifacts/evidence/**/*.log
